Local reaction media lives here (gitignored except this marker).
Drop MP4/WebM/MP3/WAV/OGG/PNG/JPEG/WebP/GIF files in this folder,
then reference the plain filename in the desktop OBS Bridge panel.
Files are served only over loopback after token validation; names must
match ^[a-zA-Z0-9][a-zA-Z0-9._-]*$ and stay under 128 characters.
